      "hunk_id": "H004",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "“like a private hearing reveille” tracks 기상나팔 소리를 들은 이등병; BASE adds “startled awake,” not in source."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H005",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "“stunned twice over” reads more naturally than “startled twice” while keeping 두 번 놀랐다."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H006",
      "decision": "BASE",
      "reason": "SOL’s “heart pounding” collides with the later 쿵쾅거린다 rendering; BASE’s “heart skip” keeps 떨리다 distinct."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H007",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "Korean 벗은 몸 (naked body) is explicit; BASE censors it to “herself.” SOL also “provocative” for 자극적인."
    },
